 "notes": "Brand mode: tier. Merged Whey protein, Casein protein and 'Other protein powders' into one Protein powder kind (types: whey concentrate/isolate/hydrolysed, casein, plant, clear, diet, egg-white). Broke ON/Cellucor skew: added Myprotein, MuscleTech, Dymatize, Bulk, PhD, Huel, Vega, Applied Nutrition plus independent test winners (Forbes lab test: Transparent Labs Grass-Fed Whey; Garage Gym Reviews: Transparent Labs Mass Gainer; Yahoo dietitian tests: Thorne Creatine, Transparent Labs Bulk pre-workout; TrustedHealthGear: BodyHealth PerfectAmino). Pre-workout capped at 2 per brand (dropped C4 AlphaBomb, C4 Sport, C4 Sport Ripped; C4 Ultimate kept from old data). Dropped Cellucor C4 Whey, ON Gold Standard Isolate, Platinum HydroWhey, ON Clear Protein and ON Glutamine Capsules to reduce ON/Cellucor share; Lipocrush (Forzagen) and Embrax (Project#1) dropped from fat burners as minor long-tail SKUs. Brand register limited to brands with a retrieved brand page (Wikipedia); Dymatize, Bulk, PhD, Transparent Labs, Thorne, Ghost, Kaged, BSN not registered (no brand page retrieved this session). XTEND kept under Cellucor (both Nutrabolt) as in old data. Definitions make no efficacy claims. Protein bars belong to J8 (none on this shelf). No moves; no traditions apply.",
